      <title>The Los Angeles Left Is Fighting About Housing</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-08-29/the-los-angeles-left-is-fighting-about-housing</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">820c1520d599a921bb0cae8f</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Democratic socialism is having a moment — and, for much of the Democratic Party establishment, it’s been a moment of pure panic. Nithya Raman, a member of the Democratic Socialists of America who is running for Los Angeles mayor, seemed to understand this when she was asked during a recent debate how her lefty politics would affect running America’s second-largest city.</description>
